    "content": "<div class=\"ml-en\"><span class=\"eyebrow\">EXE101 · Chapter 1 · Session 2</span>\n<h2>Session 2 — Week 1</h2>\n<p class=\"nhan\">Source: FLM syllabus 10358 · session plan</p></div>\n<div class=\"ml-vi\"><span class=\"eyebrow\">EXE101 · Chương 1 · Buổi 2</span>\n<h2>Buổi 2 — Week 1</h2>\n<p class=\"nhan\">Nguồn: syllabus FLM 10358 · kế hoạch buổi</p></div>\n<div class=\"ml-en\"><div class=\"kv-grid\">\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">Type</span><span class=\"v\">Offline</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">LO</span><span class=\"v\">CLO2</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">ITU</span><span class=\"v\">T,U</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">Slides in this lesson</span><span class=\"v\">none from FLM</span></div>\n</div></div>\n<div class=\"ml-vi\"><div class=\"kv-grid\">\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">Hình thức</span><span class=\"v\">Offline</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">LO</span><span class=\"v\">CLO2</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">ITU</span><span class=\"v\">T,U</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">Slide trong bài</span><span class=\"v\">FLM không có</span></div>\n</div></div>\n<div class=\"ml-en\"><h3>What this session covers (FLM, verbatim)</h3></div>\n<div class=\"ml-vi\"><h3>Nội dung buổi học (FLM, nguyên văn)</h3></div>\n<p>Week 1<br><br>Seminar 1<br><br>“Be Successful in Your Own Way” – Guest speaker</p>\n<div class=\"ml-en\"><h3>Student's tasks</h3></div>\n<div class=\"ml-vi\"><h3>Nhiệm vụ sinh viên</h3></div>\n<p>- Attend the seminar<br><br>During Seminar:<br><br>- Prepare questions for Guest speakers</p>\n<div class=\"ml-en\"><h3>Constructive questions — answer them yourself first</h3></div>\n<div class=\"ml-vi\"><h3>Câu hỏi kiến tạo — tự trả lời trước</h3></div>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>HCM2.1</strong> — Should I work first or just start a company?</li>\n<li><strong>HCM2.2</strong> — Why did you choose your team members? Any criteria? How do you structure team and divide the work within your team?</li>\n<li><strong>HCM2.3</strong> — Which factors will decide the success of a startup? Please list out 3 factors</li>\n<li><strong>HCM2.4</strong> — Why does your idea need to be 10x?</li>\n</ul>\n<div class=\"ml-en\"><div class=\"note-ct\">📝 Detailed lecture and 🎬 video for this session: coming later. For now follow the slides, the materials and the tasks above.</div></div>\n<div class=\"ml-vi\"><div class=\"note-ct\">📝 Bài giảng chi tiết và 🎬 video cho buổi này: sẽ bổ sung sau. Trước mắt học theo slide, tài liệu và nhiệm vụ ở trên.</div></div>"
