    "content": "<div class=\"ml-en\"><span class=\"eyebrow\">EXE101 · Chapter 2 · Session 3</span>\n<h2>Session 3 — Week 2</h2>\n<p class=\"nhan\">Source: FLM syllabus 10358 · session plan</p></div>\n<div class=\"ml-vi\"><span class=\"eyebrow\">EXE101 · Chương 2 · Buổi 3</span>\n<h2>Buổi 3 — Week 2</h2>\n<p class=\"nhan\">Nguồn: syllabus FLM 10358 · kế hoạch buổi</p></div>\n<div class=\"ml-en\"><div class=\"kv-grid\">\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">Type</span><span class=\"v\">Online, offline</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">LO</span><span class=\"v\">2</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">ITU</span><span class=\"v\">T,U</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">Slides in this lesson</span><span class=\"v\">none from FLM</span></div>\n</div></div>\n<div class=\"ml-vi\"><div class=\"kv-grid\">\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">Hình thức</span><span class=\"v\">Online, offline</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">LO</span><span class=\"v\">2</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">ITU</span><span class=\"v\">T,U</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">Slide trong bài</span><span class=\"v\">FLM không có</span></div>\n</div></div>\n<div class=\"ml-en\"><h3>What this session covers (FLM, verbatim)</h3></div>\n<div class=\"ml-vi\"><h3>Nội dung buổi học (FLM, nguyên văn)</h3></div>\n<p>Week 2<br><br>Instructor's coaching<br><br>Form a Winning Team<br><br>1 offline session (2,25 hrs)</p>\n<div class=\"ml-en\"><h3>Materials to read</h3></div>\n<div class=\"ml-vi\"><h3>Tài liệu cần đọc</h3></div>\n<p>Watch video lectures below:<br><br>a) How to Find the Right Co-founder (Link: <a href=\"https://www.ycombinator.com/library/8h-how-to-find-the-right-co-founder\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">https://www.ycombinator.com/library/8h-how-to-find-the-right-co-founder</a>)<br><br>b) How to Work Together (Link: <a href=\"https://www.ycombinator.com/library/6n-how-to-work-together\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">https://www.ycombinator.com/library/6n-how-to-work-together</a>)<br><br>c) (Optional) How to Find a Co-founder (Link: <a href=\"https://www.ycombinator.com/library/7j-how-to-find-a-co-founder\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">https://www.ycombinator.com/library/7j-how-to-find-a-co-founder</a>)<br><br>d) (Optional) How do You Convince Someone to Join Your Startup? (Link: <a href=\"https://www.ycombinator.com/library/5b-how-do-you-convince-someone-to-join-your-startup\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">https://www.ycombinator.com/library/5b-how-do-you-convince-someone-to-join-your-startup</a>)<br><br>- (Optional) Read book The Lean Startup, chapter 2</p>\n<div class=\"ml-en\"><h3>Student's tasks</h3></div>\n<div class=\"ml-vi\"><h3>Nhiệm vụ sinh viên</h3></div>\n<p>Before class:<br><br>- Watch video lectures and note down key points of each video.<br><br>- Prepare answer for the assigned constructive question.<br><br>- Research and prepare arguments on the constructive questions assigned to other groups.<br><br>During class:<br><br>- Answer and debate on the constructive questions<br><br>After class:<br><br>- Brainstorm a startup idea: products/services and customer segment.<br><br>- Prepare for Checkpoint 1</p>\n<div class=\"ml-en\"><h3>Constructive questions — answer them yourself first</h3></div>\n<div class=\"ml-vi\"><h3>Câu hỏi kiến tạo — tự trả lời trước</h3></div>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>HCM3.1</strong> — What are the similarities between a startup and an SME?</li>\n<li><strong>HCM3.2</strong> — What are the key differences between a startup and an SME?</li>\n<li><strong>HCM3.3</strong> — Why customer interviews questions is different from a research paper interview questions?</li>\n<li><strong>HCM3.4</strong> — Do you prefer a small market or a big market? Why?</li>\n</ul>\n<div class=\"ml-en\"><div class=\"note-ct\">📝 Detailed lecture and 🎬 video for this session: coming later. For now follow the slides, the materials and the tasks above.</div></div>\n<div class=\"ml-vi\"><div class=\"note-ct\">📝 Bài giảng chi tiết và 🎬 video cho buổi này: sẽ bổ sung sau. Trước mắt học theo slide, tài liệu và nhiệm vụ ở trên.</div></div>"
